  - m_Id: 137269394388168704
    m_Localized: "<b> Dikkat: </b> Dikkat: Kutu rengi \xFCr\xFCnle uyu\u015Fmuyorsa
      paketleme ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z olur ve kutu elinde k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.
      Renk kontrol\xFCn\xFC paketlemeden \xF6nce yap, kutunu bo\u015Fa harcama."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269394430111744
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu: </b>F\u0131rlat\u0131p yakalama, iki ki\u015Filik
      bir istasyonda zaman kazand\u0131r\u0131r ama al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k h\xE2line
      getirme \u2014 her d\xFC\u015F\xFCrme cebinden gider."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605470711808
    m_Localized: "RAFA YERLE\u015ET\u0130RME"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906112
    m_Localized: "Raflar Cargor'un can damar\u0131. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131, sar\u0131
      ve mavi olmak \xFCzere \xFC\xE7 bo\u015F kutu t\xFCr\xFC hep orada bekler \u2014
      birini ald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda raf kendini k\u0131sa s\xFCre i\xE7inde tazeler,
      yani asla tamamen bo\u015F kalmaz. Elinde fazladan bir kutu ya da paketlenmi\u015F
      bir \xFCr\xFCn varsa ve o an ta\u015F\u0131mak istemiyorsan, rafa geri koyabilirsin.
      D\xFCzenli bir raf, hem senin hem tak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n i\u015Fini kolayla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r
      \u2014 herkes ne nerede bulaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906113
    m_Localized: "\xDCR\xDCNLER NASIL PAKETLEN\u0130R"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906114
    m_Localized: TEMEL HAREKETLER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294720
    m_Localized: "<b>Y\xFCr\xFC / Ko\u015F</b> \u2013 depoda dola\u015Fman\u0131
      sa\u011Flar.\n\n<b>Al / B\u0131rak</b> \u2013 yerdeki, masadaki veya raftaki
      bir e\u015Fyay\u0131 elinle al ya da b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n yere koy.\n\n<b>F\u0131rlat</b>
      \u2013 elindekini uza\u011Fa at. H\u0131zl\u0131 ama riskli: sert \xE7arparsa
      k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r, para ve itibar kaybedersin. Bir tak\u0131m arkada\u015F\u0131na
      at\u0131p yakalat\u0131rsan ceza yok \u2013 \xFCstelik zaman kazand\u0131r\u0131r.\n\n<b>Etkile\u015Fim</b>
      \u2013 m\xFC\u015Fterilerle konu\u015Fmak, telefonu a\xE7mak, raftan/masadan
      e\u015Fya almak hep bu tu\u015Fla olur.\n\n<b>Harita / Stok Kontrol\xFC</b>
      \u2013 deponun genel g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFCn\xFC a\xE7ar; hangi e\u015Fya nerede
      duruyor g\xF6rebilirsin. Tak\u0131m arkada\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131n konumunu
      g\xF6stermez \u2013 onu telsizden sorman gerekecek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294721
    m_Localized: "\xDCR\xDCNLER\r\nNASIL\r\nPAKETLEN\u0130R"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294722
    m_Localized: "Bir m\xFC\u015Fteriyle konu\u015Ftu\u011Funda, senden bir \xFCr\xFCn
      ister ve onu kendi masas\u0131na b\u0131rak\u0131r. \u0130\u015Fin orada bitmiyor
      \u2014 o \xFCr\xFCn hen\xFCz paketlenmemi\u015F.\n\nPaketleme ad\u0131mlar\u0131:\n\nM\xFC\u015Fterinin
      b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131 \xE7\u0131plak \xFCr\xFCn\xFC al.\n\nEn yak\u0131n
      paketleme masas\u0131na git.\n\nRafdan \xFCr\xFCnle ayn\u0131 renkte bo\u015F
      bir kutu al.\n\nMasada \xFCr\xFCn\xFC ve kutuyu bir araya getir \u2014 \xF6nce
      bantla sonra etiketle art\u0131k paket haz\u0131r.\n\nElinde art\u0131k paketlenmi\u015F
      bir kutu var. \u015Eimdi s\u0131rada teslimat var (bkz. Sayfa 6)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859394301952
    m_Localized: "M\xFC\u015Fteriler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859406884864
    m_Localized: "Cargor tek ba\u015F\u0131na da oynan\u0131r ama ger\xE7ek e\u011Flence
      tak\u0131mla ba\u015Flar. Birka\xE7 pratik \xF6neri:\n\n- <b>\u0130\u015Fi
      b\xF6l\xFC\u015F\xFCn:</b> Biri paketleme masas\u0131nda dursun, biri t\u0131rlara
      ko\u015Fsun, biri m\xFC\u015Fterilerle ilgilensin.\n- <b>Konu\u015Fun: </b>Ayn\u0131
      odada de\u011Filseniz birbirinizi g\xF6remeyebilirsiniz \u2014 nerede ne oldu\u011Funu
      haritadan kontrol edip sesli olarak payla\u015F\u0131n.\n- <b>F\u0131rlat\u0131p
      yakalay\u0131n:</b> \u0130ki istasyon aras\u0131nda mekik dokumak yerine, kutuyu
      do\u011Frudan tak\u0131m arkada\u015F\u0131na f\u0131rlat\u0131n.\n- <b>Y\xFCkseltmelerde
      uzla\u015F\u0131n:</b> Kal\u0131c\u0131 se\xE7imler herkesi etkiler, tek ba\u015F\u0131na
      karar vermeyin.\n\n\u0130yi \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar \u2014 Cargor'a ho\u015F
      geldin!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079168
    m_Localized: "Cargor'a Ho\u015F Geldin!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079169
    m_Localized: "Telefon Hatt\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079170
    m_Localized: "Depodaki telefonla s\u0131radaki m\xFC\u015Fteriyi sen \xE7a\u011F\u0131rabilirsin.
      Telefona gidip tu\u015Fu bas\u0131l\u0131 tut: m\xFC\u015Fteri hemen gelir
      ve itibar kazan\u0131rs\u0131n.\n\nAma arama bedava de\u011Fil \u2014 g\xFCn\xFCn
      saati ileri atlar. Telefon do\u011Frudan para vermez; paray\u0131 gelen m\xFC\u015Fteriyi
      do\u011Fru teslimatla memnun ederek kazan\u0131rs\u0131n. Bo\u015F durdu\u011Fun,
      m\xFC\u015Fteri beklemedi\u011Fin anlarda kullan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273472
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>G\xFCn sonuna yakla\u015F\u0131rken elindeki
      i\u015Fi bitirip erkenden dinlenme odas\u0131na y\xF6nel \u2014 tak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131
      bekletme."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273473
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel Talepler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273474
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>Tak\u0131m\u0131nla konu\u015Fmadan se\xE7im
      yapma \u2014 bir ki\u015Finin ald\u0131\u011F\u0131 y\xFCkseltme, herkesin
      i\u015Fleyi\u015Fini de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273475
    m_Localized: "Her g\xFCn panoda birka\xE7 g\xF6rev teklifi g\xF6r\xFCrs\xFCn
      \u2014 rafa kutu koymak, \xFCr\xFCn paketlemek, t\u0131r tamamlamak, telefona
      cevap vermek gibi. Bir g\xFCnde yaln\u0131z bir tanesini kabul edebilirsin.\n\n-
      Kabul etti\u011Fin g\xF6revi g\xFCn bitmeden tamamlarsan, g\xFCn sonunda \xF6d\xFCl\xFCn
      otomatik hesab\u0131na yatar.\n\n- Kabul edip yar\u0131m b\u0131rak\u0131rsan,
      g\xFCn sonunda ceza uygulan\u0131r.\n\nKabul etmezsen hi\xE7bir \u015Fey olmaz
      \u2014 ama f\u0131rsat\u0131 da ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131rs\u0131n. Elindeki i\u015Fe
      g\xF6re ger\xE7ek\xE7i bir g\xF6rev se\xE7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273476
    m_Localized: "Ekip \xC7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131 \u0130pu\xE7lar\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273477
    m_Localized: Kira ve Paran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467776
    m_Localized: "Cargor'u i\u015Fletmek \xFCcretsiz de\u011Fil. Belirli g\xFCnlerde
      kira \xF6demesi gelir \u2014 bu g\xFCne \"kira g\xFCn\xFC\" diyoruz.\n\n- Kiray\u0131
      \xF6deyecek paran varsa, \xF6denir ve devam edersin.\n\n- \u0130lk \xF6demede
      tarihinde \xD6deyemezsen bir kerelik bir \u015Fans var: elindeki paran\u0131n
      b\xFCy\xFCk bir k\u0131sm\u0131 al\u0131n\u0131r ama i\u015Fletme kapanmaz.\n\n<b>Para;
      </b>do\u011Fru teslimatlardan ve tamamlanan g\xF6revlerden gelir. Yanl\u0131\u015F
      teslimat, d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFClen kutular ve yar\u0131m b\u0131rak\u0131lan
      g\xF6revler paran\u0131 azalt\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467777
    m_Localized: "<b> Unutma:  </b>Burada yaln\u0131z de\u011Filsin. Cargor bir tak\u0131m
      i\u015Fi \u2014 y\xFCk\xFCn\xFC payla\u015F, sesini duyur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467778
    m_Localized: "Do\u011Fru renk teslim et \u2192 para kazan\u0131rs\u0131n, itibar\u0131n
      artar.\n\nYanl\u0131\u015F renk teslim et \u2192 para kaybedersin. Renklere
      iki kere bak.\n\nHer t\u0131r\u0131n s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 bir bekleme s\xFCresi
      ve kapasitesi var. Doldu\u011Funda ya da s\xFCresi bitti\u011Finde t\u0131r
      ayr\u0131l\u0131r, yenisi gelir.\n\nDepo b\xFCy\xFCd\xFCk\xE7e (y\xFCkseltmelerle)
      birden fazla hangar a\xE7\u0131labilir \u2014 ayn\u0131 anda birka\xE7 t\u0131r\u0131
      besleyebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856384
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>Kar\u0131\u015F\u0131k t\u0131r ya da \xE7ift
      sipari\u015F g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCnde panik yapma \u2014 sadece iki ayr\u0131
      teslimat gibi d\xFC\u015F\xFCn, art arda hallet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856385
    m_Localized: "Y\xFCkseltmeler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856386
    m_Localized: "G\xFCn sona erdi\u011Finde herkesin dinlenme odas\u0131na gitmesi
      gerekir. Tek bir ki\u015Fi bile d\u0131\u015Far\u0131da kalsa, g\xFCn kapanmaz
      \u2014 tak\u0131m tam olarak toplanana kadar beklenir.\n\nHerkes odaya girdi\u011Finde
      g\xFCn \xF6zeti g\xF6sterilir ve yeni g\xFCn ba\u015Flar. On alt\u0131nc\u0131
      g\xFCn\xFCn sonuna kadar iflas etmeden gelebilirsen, kutlamay\u0131 hak ettin
      demektir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859432050688
    m_Localized: "Dinlenme Odas\u0131 ve G\xFCn Sonu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859432050689
    m_Localized: "M\xFC\u015Fteriler kap\u0131dan girer, s\u0131raya girer ve senden
      bir \u015Fey ister. \xDCzerlerindeki bar, ne kadar sab\u0131rl\u0131 olduklar\u0131n\u0131
      g\xF6sterir \u2014 bar biterse m\xFC\u015Fteri \xF6fkeyle ayr\u0131l\u0131r,
      sen de para ve itibar kaybedersin.\n\n- G\xFCn i\xE7inde yo\u011Funluk de\u011Fi\u015Fir:
      \xF6\u011Fle ve ak\u015Fam saatleri en kalabal\u0131k zamanlar, \xF6\u011Fleden
      sonra biraz nefes al\u0131rs\u0131n.\n\n- Bir m\xFC\u015Fteriyle konu\u015Ftu\u011Funda
      (etkile\u015Fim tu\u015Fu) istedi\u011Fi \xFCr\xFCn\xFC masas\u0131na b\u0131rak\u0131r
      \u2014 bundan sonras\u0131 paketleme ve teslimatt\u0131r (Sayfa 4-6).\n\n-
      Zaman\u0131nda hizmet etti\u011Fin her m\xFC\u015Fteri hem para hem itibar
      kazand\u0131r\u0131r. \u0130tibar\u0131n y\xFCkseldik\xE7e teslimat ba\u015F\u0131na
      kazanc\u0131n da artar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244992
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>Zor bir g\xF6revi son g\xFCne kadar erteleme.
      G\xFCn sonu her zaman bekledi\u011Finden \xE7abuk gelir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244993
    m_Localized: "\u0130adeler, \xC7ift Sipari\u015F, Kar\u0131\u015F\u0131k T\u0131rlar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244994
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>Telefon zaman yakar \u2014 s\u0131rada m\xFC\u015Fteri
      yokken ara, m\xFC\u015Fteri beklerken de\u011Fil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633600
    m_Localized: "HO\u015E\r\nGELD\u0130N!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633601
    m_Localized: "G\xF6rev Panosu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633602
    m_Localized: "G\xFCnler ilerledik\xE7e i\u015F biraz kar\u0131\u015F\u0131yor.
      \xDC\xE7 yeni durumla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Facaks\u0131n:\n\n<b>\u0130adeler:
      </b>Baz\u0131 m\xFC\u015Fteriler \xFCr\xFCn istemez, tam tersini yapar \u2014
      sana bir kutu geri getirmeni ister. \xDCzerlerinde beliren renkli k\xFCre,
      hangi renk kutu istediklerini g\xF6sterir. Rafdan do\u011Fru rengi al, m\xFC\u015Fteriye
      g\xF6t\xFCr.\n\n<b>\xC7ift sipari\u015F: </b>Baz\u0131 m\xFC\u015Fteriler tek
      seferde iki farkl\u0131 renk ister. \u0130kisini de haz\u0131rlamadan i\u015F
      bitmez.\n\n<b>Kar\u0131\u015F\u0131k t\u0131r: </b>Baz\u0131 t\u0131rlar tek
      renk de\u011Fil, iki farkl\u0131 renk kutu birden ister. G\xF6vdesindeki kar\u0131\u015F\u0131k
      renk (\xF6rne\u011Fin k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 + sar\u0131 = turuncu) sana ipucu
      verir \u2014 hangi iki rengi y\xFCklemen gerekti\u011Fini g\xF6sterir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633603
    m_Localized: "Hangarda bekleyen t\u0131rlar, g\xF6vde rengiyle sana ne istediklerini
      g\xF6sterir: k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 t\u0131r k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kutu ister,
      sar\u0131 t\u0131r sar\u0131, mavi t\u0131r mavi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859448827904
    m_Localized: "Ho\u015F geldin! Art\u0131k Cargor ailesinin bir par\xE7as\u0131s\u0131n.
      Buras\u0131 bir depo, bir ma\u011Faza ve biraz da kaos \u2014 hepsi bir arada.\n\nM\xFC\u015Fteriler
      sana ne istediklerini s\xF6yler, sen onu paketler, do\u011Fru t\u0131ra y\xFCklersin.
      Basit g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor, de\u011Fil mi? On alt\u0131 g\xFCn sonra h\xE2l\xE2
      ayaktaysan, ger\xE7ekten iyi i\u015F \xE7\u0131karm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n demektir.\n\nElindeki
      bu defter, i\u015Fin inceliklerini unuttu\u011Funda ba\u015Fvuraca\u011F\u0131n
      yer. Her sayfa farkl\u0131 bir konuyu anlat\u0131yor. Aceleye gerek yok \u2014
      ilk g\xFCnlerde yava\u015F \xE7al\u0131\u015F, sistemi \xF6\u011Fren. H\u0131z\u0131n
      zamanla gelecek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022208
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>Kira g\xFCnleri \xF6ncesinde elindeki nakdi
      kontrol et. Son ana b\u0131rakma."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022209
    m_Localized: "<b> Dikkat:  </b>S\u0131ra doluyken yeni m\xFC\u015Fteri gelmez
      ama s\u0131radakiler sab\u0131rs\u0131zlanmaya devam eder. Kuyru\u011Fu eritmeden
      yeni i\u015Fe ba\u015Flama."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022210
    m_Localized: "<b> \u0130pucu:  </b>T\u0131r rengini uzaktan g\xF6rebiliyorsan,
      elindeki kutuyla e\u015Fle\u015Fen t\u0131ra \xF6ncelik ver \u2014 bo\u015Funa
      y\xFCr\xFCme."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859461410816
    m_Localized: "TIRLAR VE TESL\u0130MAT"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859465605120
    m_Localized: "Belirli g\xFCnlerde \xF6n\xFCne birka\xE7 y\xFCkseltme se\xE7ene\u011Fi
      gelir \u2014 hepsini alamazs\u0131n, aralar\u0131ndan se\xE7im yapars\u0131n.
      Ek raf, ek hangar, daha h\u0131zl\u0131 hareket, daha uzun sab\u0131r s\xFCresi
      gibi kal\u0131c\u0131 iyile\u015Ftirmeler kazanabilirsin.\n\nSe\xE7imini iyi
      d\xFC\u015F\xFCn: baz\u0131 y\xFCkseltmeler birbirini d\u0131\u015Flar, baz\u0131lar\u0131
      belli bir g\xFCne kadar a\xE7\u0131lmaz. Erken g\xFCnlerde temel i\u015Fleyi\u015Fi
      h\u0131zland\u0131ran se\xE7imler, ileride i\u015Fine \xE7ok yarar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416780595200
    m_Localized: "Cargor'a ho\u015F geldin! E\u015Fyalar\u0131 m\xFC\u015Fterilerden
      al\u0131p ara\xE7lara teslim edeceksin. Devam etmek i\xE7in [SPACE] tu\u015Funa
      bas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416847704064
    m_Localized: "M\xFC\u015Fteriye gidip [{0}] tu\u015Funa basarak sipari\u015Fini
      al, sonra masan\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde tekrar [{0}] tu\u015Funa basarak \xFCr\xFCn\xFC
      al."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416847704065
    m_Localized: "\xDCr\xFCn\xFC paketleme masas\u0131na g\xF6t\xFCr ve \xF6n\xFCnde
      [{0}] tu\u015Funa basarak b\u0131rak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092672
    m_Localized: "Raftan uygun kutuyu almak i\xE7in \xF6n\xFCnde [{0}] tu\u015Funa
      bas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092673
    m_Localized: "Kutuyu paketleme masas\u0131na g\xF6t\xFCr, [{0}] tu\u015Funa bas \u2014 \xFCr\xFCn kutuya konur ama kutu a\xE7\u0131k kal\u0131r, sonra bantlay\u0131p kapatman gerekir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263129
    m_Localized: "Bant almak i\xE7in bant istasyonunun \xF6n\xFCnde [{0}] tu\u015Funa bas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263130
    m_Localized: "Band\u0131 elinde tutarken paketleme masas\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde [{0}] tu\u015Funa basarak a\xE7\u0131k kutuyu kapat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092674
    m_Localized: "Bantlanm\u0131\u015F kutuyu almak i\xE7in masan\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde tekrar [{0}] tu\u015Funa bas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092675
    m_Localized: "Kutuyu rafa yerle\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in [{0}] tu\u015Funa bas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092676
    m_Localized: "Ara\xE7 geliyor, biraz bekle..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092677
    m_Localized: "Paketi tekrar almak i\xE7in raf\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde [{0}] tu\u015Funa
      bas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092678
    m_Localized: "Paketi t\u0131r\u0131n arkas\u0131na g\xF6t\xFCr ve f\u0131rlat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092679
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7mek i\xE7in [SPACE] tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416860286976
    m_Localized: "Tutorial tamamland\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263131
    m_Localized: "Steam ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 yok!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263132
    m_Localized: "Lobi olu\u015Fturulamad\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263133
    m_Localized: "Lobiye kat\u0131l\u0131namad\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263134
    m_Localized: "Ba\u011Flant\u0131 hatas\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263135
    m_Localized: "A\u011F hatas\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263136
    m_Localized: "Host ba\u015Flat\u0131lamad\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263137
    m_Localized: "Host hatas\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263138
    m_Localized: "Ba\u011Flant\u0131 ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263139
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7ersiz lobi!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263140
    m_Localized: "Lobi hatas\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263141
    m_Localized: "Beklenmeyen hata olu\u015Ftu!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263142
    m_Localized: "L\xFCtfen bir lobi kodu girin!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263143
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7ersiz lobi kodu!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263144
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7erli bir lobi yok!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263145
    m_Localized: "Lobi do\u011Frulanamad\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263146
    m_Localized: "\xD6nce bir lobi olu\u015Fturmal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263147
    m_Localized: "Steam davet men\xFCs\xFC a\xE7\u0131lamad\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263148
    m_Localized: "Sadece host oyunu ba\u015Flatabilir!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263149
    m_Localized: "A\u011F haz\u0131r de\u011Fil!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263150
    m_Localized: "Sahne y\xFCklenemedi!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263151
    m_Localized: "Lobi mevcut de\u011Fil!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263152
    m_Localized: "Lobiye girme yetkiniz yok!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263153
    m_Localized: "Lobi dolu!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263154
    m_Localized: "Bu lobiden banland\u0131n\u0131z!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263155
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263156
    m_Localized: "Klan devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
